Logical Formula:
5G SA Complete Accessibility Success Ratio = 100* (SR_InitialSetup * Weight_InitialSetup) + 100* (SR_Resume * Weight_Resume) 
where:
SR_InitialSetup = SR_RRC_Initial_Access_FB * SR_Initial_UE_Message * SR_Logical_Connection * SR_UE_Context_Setup;
SR_Resume = SR_RRC_Resume_Non_FB: Success rate of RRC Resume procedures, excluding those with fallback, but including RNA Update related events;
Weight_InitialSetup = Total_RRC_Setup_Attempts_Weighted / Total_Overall_Access_Attempts;
Weight_Resume = Total_RRC_Resume_Attempts_Non_FB / Total_Overall_Access_Attempts;
Total_RRC_Setup_Attempts_Weighted: Sum of all RRC setup requests (various service types) + Sum of RRC resume fallback attempts;
Total_RRC_Resume_Attempts_Non_FB: Sum of all RRC resume requests - Sum of RRC resume fallback attempts;
Total_Overall_Access_Attempts: Sum of all RRC setup requests (various service types) + Sum of all RRC resume requests including fallbacks.
